  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> giây, bánh xe quay được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>11</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></semantics></math> (vòng).<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> vòng ứng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>360</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math> nên góc mà bánh xe quay được trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> giây là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>11</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>360</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>792</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> vòng ứng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> rad nên góc mà bánh xe quay được trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> giây là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>11</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>22</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>(rad).</li><li>Đổi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> phút <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></semantics></math> s.<br>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>60</mn></semantics></math> giây, bánh xe quay được số vòng là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>11</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>132</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (vòng).<br>Chu vi mỗi vòng xe là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>680</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (mm).<br>Độ dài quãng đường người đó đi trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> phút là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>132</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>680</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>89760</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (mm).</li></ol>",
